  "description": "LEAVE THE VALLEY BEHIND. Since 2018, the ALTO has proudly carried its name. Derived from the Italian and Spanish word for “high,” it represents those moments when the roads get steeper, the air gets thinner, and the summit draws ever closer. Nothing was left to chance in the development of the latest generation ALTO. Feedback from our athletes was incorporated directly into the design process and combined with insights gained from some of the world’s most demanding races. At the same time, every detail was refined in the wind tunnel to further enhance aerodynamics and riding dynamics. The result is a road bike that perfectly balances low weight, high stiffness, and modern aerodynamic performance. Efficient on the climbs, confident on the descents, and fast on every stretch of road. Every tube shape, every line, and every detail serves a single purpose: delivering maximum performance on every ride. The ALTO also sets new benchmarks when it comes to specification. The top-tier models EXONIC, PRESTIGE, PRIME, and MASTER come equipped with a power meter and a fully integrated FSA cockpit as standard, further emphasizing the bike’s uncompromising performance-focused character.",
